			description: [
				"Incendium reshapes Nether exploration with large structures and dangerous terrain. Existing chunks stay unchanged; new terrain holds the additions."
				"Incendium transforms the Nether through terrain, structures, and encounters while preserving its identity. Build protected roads and portal stations because open sprinting creates more chunks, more risk, and no reusable route."
				"YUNG's Better Nether Fortresses changes a familiar objective into a larger route problem. Bring fire resistance, blocks, ranged weapons, marked exits, and enough food to retreat without abandoning navigation."
